  "expect": ["responsible(jia,x,robbery)", "convicted(jia,x,robbery)", "O sentence(jia,x,lighterOrReduced)"]},
 {"id": "age-3", "title": "15岁的甲盗窃后为抗拒抓捕当场打伤失主致重伤（多跳：转化抢劫 → 司法解释排除 → 故意伤害）",
  "facts": ["age14to16(jia)", "takesSecretly(jia,x)", "illegalPossessionPurpose(jia,x)", "amountRelativelyLarge(x)", "violenceOnTheSpot(jia,x)",
