  "facts": ["age16to18(yi)", "takesSecretly(yi,x)", "illegalPossessionPurpose(yi,x)", "amountRelativelyLarge(x)", "violenceOnTheSpot(yi,x)", "toResistArrest(yi,x)"],
  "expect": ["convicted(yi,x,robbery)", "-convicted(yi,x,theft)", "O sentence(yi,x,lighterOrReduced)"]},
 {"id": "age-5", "title": "13岁的丙故意杀人，情节恶劣，经最高检核准追诉",
