 {"id": "cap-1", "title": "精神病人发病时伤人，经鉴定确认",
  "facts": ["adult(d)", "intentionallyInjures(d,x)", "mentallyIll(d)", "unableToRecognizeOrControlAtTime(d,x)", "forensicallyCertified(d)"],
