 {"id": "def-2", "title": "对一般推搡（非严重暴力）用刀反击致重伤（防卫过当）",
  "facts": ["adult(yi)", "intentionallyInjures(yi,x)", "defensiveAct(yi,x)", "ongoingUnlawfulAttack(x)", "harmToAttacker(x)", "defensiveIntent(yi,x)",
            "obviouslyExceedsNecessity(x)", "causesSeriousHarm(x)"],
  "expect": ["excessiveDefense(yi,x)", "convicted(yi,x,intentionalInjury)", "O sentence(yi,x,reducedOrExempt)", "!justifiedDefense(yi,x)"]},
 {"id": "def-3", "title": "抢劫者已逃走后追上去打伤（事后防卫）",
  "facts": ["adult(yi)", "intentionallyInjures(yi,x)", "defensiveAct(yi,x)", "attackAlreadyEnded(x)", "harmToAttacker(x)", "defensiveIntent(yi,x)"],
